    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana crystals have been appearing all around the world. The cause: unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The adventurer's guild has been created to manage the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are playing as a novice adventurer who just enlisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple. Complete guild quests to restore order and find what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guild has entrusted you with a wand capable of unleashing powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now ready to take on quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive\u2014if you fall, you\u2019ll never unleash your full power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun chaos destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 elements to combine unlocking different way to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic and immersive combat. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embrace the journey of <strong>The Novice</strong>? <strong>Find the source of the madness now!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana crystals have been appearing all around the world. The cause: unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The adventurer's guild has been created to manage the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are playing as a novice adventurer who just enlisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple. Complete guild quests to restore order and find what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guild has entrusted you with a wand capable of unleashing powerful spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now ready to take on quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive\u2014if you fall, you\u2019ll never unleash your full power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun chaos destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 elements to combine unlocking different way to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic and immersive combat. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embrace the journey of <strong>The Novice</strong>? <strong>Find the source of the madness now!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Survive relentless waves of burning beasts. Collect gems and complete quests to buy powerful upgrades. Rise through the ranks of the adventurer\u2019s guild to unlock new map and quests. Your goal: find the cause of the chaos!",
